===============================================================================
ERRORS PRESENT IN THE PRINTED ORIGINAL (transcribed as-is, not corrected)
===============================================================================

Page 2, §10.1:
  - "said premises to Leasee, Lessee agrees"     — "Leasee" for "Lessee"
  - "and Lessee, his gents, employees"           — "gents" for "agents"
  - "after such notices have e been given"       — stray "e"
  - "as a non-interest bearing deposit (and is not a rental payment to be
     refunded as hereinafter provided in the Lease Agreement, in the event
     the application is approved..."             — the "(" never closes
  - "...personal representatives of Lessee, as the case may be, arising out
     of any representatives of Lessee, as the case may be, arising out of
     any and all claims..."                      — the clause repeats, and the
                                                   first half appears truncated

Page 1:
  - The form asks for Social Security # and Sex; both are circled by hand on
    the scan. Collecting either on a rental application carries fair-housing
    and data-handling exposure — flagged here only because the annotations
    single them out, not as legal advice.
